WEBVTT

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.580
﻿I see it, Reiji.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.510
﻿He's our opponent for the final round.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.550
﻿Yeah.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.420
﻿Gundam Double X!

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:20.030
﻿This is the power of the famous
﻿Magician of Armies! Look well!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.060
﻿G-Bits!?

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.530
﻿What are those?

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:29.630
﻿They're unmanned mobile suits
﻿remotely controlled by the Flash System.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.400
﻿Fighting is about numbers!

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.870
﻿Even if the performance of each is low,

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:38.240
﻿I'll surround and destroy
﻿the enemy with force of numbers.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:44.950
﻿One single machine
﻿can't resist my army!

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:56.460
﻿- Our Gunpla...
﻿- Isn't just for show!

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:15.610
﻿12 G-Bits wiped out?

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:17.750
<i>﻿Fire twin satellite cannon!</i>

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:18.750
﻿I know that!

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.630
﻿I'll tell you one thing.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.900
﻿Fighting is about quality,
﻿not quantity!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.040
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.880
﻿The white Gunpla really won!

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.680
﻿But how...?

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:52.080
﻿You're perceptive.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.720
﻿It was worth taking you
﻿under my wing.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.930
﻿This extra prize for the winner
﻿is so cool!

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:32.300
﻿Hey, Sei.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.800
﻿Your grin creeps me out.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:36.700
﻿Oh, let it go.

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:41.610
﻿He's been like this since
﻿he won the tournament.

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:48.150
﻿I didn't think the extra prize
﻿would be a trip to a hot spring.

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:51.950
﻿PPSE, the tournament sponsor,
﻿is pretty thoughtful.

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:55.890
﻿Mr. Ral, thank you for driving us.

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:59.130
﻿Not at all, I'm happy to do it.

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:00.490
﻿Um...

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:04.130
﻿Was it okay that I tagged along?

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:05.730
﻿Of course it's okay.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.170
﻿The ticket was for five people anyway.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.610
﻿This is your chance, China.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.370
﻿F-For what?

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:15.180
﻿Should I spell it out for you?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.210
﻿No, please don't.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:19.910
﻿What? What?

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.620
I-It's nothing!

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.250
﻿It's good to be young!

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.300
﻿Huh?

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.640
﻿The water is so salty!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.040
﻿What's up with it?

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.780
﻿Of course. It's sea water.

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:52.280
﻿Really?

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.480
﻿Awesome!

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:59.220
﻿Is this your first time
﻿swimming in the ocean?

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.660
﻿A salty one like this, yes.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:05.560
﻿Mr. Ral, is there an ocean
﻿that isn't salty?

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.560
﻿Maybe in the colonies...

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.130
﻿We're ready, guys.

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:19.770
﻿Mrs. Rinko, you look beautiful.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.580
﻿Thank you, Mr. Ral.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:27.920
﻿I know.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:32.420
﻿I think China's swimsuit is cute, too.

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:33.620
﻿Right, Sei?

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.990
﻿Oh, I guess...

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.690
﻿The material seems good.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.230
﻿It's really well-detailed.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.770
﻿She's not a Gunpla, Sei.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:48.170
﻿Hey!

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:50.700
﻿Aren't you gonna swim?

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:52.070
﻿So, Reiji.

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.070
﻿What do you think about
﻿China's swimsuit?

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:56.880
﻿Huh? What do I think?

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:04.920
﻿I wouldn't worry about it.

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:07.620
﻿Right into the minefield!

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:09.890
﻿What's up?

00:06:16.670 --> 00:06:19.730
﻿Hey, why did I get hit?

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.900
﻿You blurt out everything
﻿without thinking first.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.410
﻿One, two...

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:26.910
﻿There.

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:31.250
﻿Got it!

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:36.250
﻿Let's start.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.280
﻿Okay.

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:39.920
﻿Nice one.

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:44.160
﻿We really won the tournament.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:46.930
﻿You're saying it again, Sei.

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:47.830
﻿Thanks.

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.030
﻿For what?

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:55.600
﻿Without you, my Gunpla
﻿would never have won.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.170
﻿Oh, come on.

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.510
﻿Are you still dreaming?

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:02.310
﻿The World Tournament's coming up.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.210
﻿Act confident, man.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.410
﻿Yeah, you're right.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:20.960
﻿This place looks really run down.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.060
﻿That's strange.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:25.900
﻿In the pamphlet,
﻿it says "high-class inn".

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:29.600
﻿An inn's quality is about
﻿the service, not the outside.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.910
﻿Hello.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.240
﻿I'm coming!

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.910
﻿Welcome.

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:40.810
﻿M-Mao!?

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:41.820
﻿Why?

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.980
﻿Who's this?

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:47.790
﻿He's Mao Yasaka, the winner
﻿of the championship's 5th Block.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:49.490
﻿Oh, I get it.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:52.460
﻿Are you here because of the extra prize?

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.690
﻿That's right.

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:58.100
﻿The winners of the other blocks
﻿must be coming on different days.

00:07:58.100 --> 00:07:59.570
﻿Are they?

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:01.030
﻿I wanted to meet them.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.540
﻿By the way,

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.240
﻿why are you dressed like that?

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.140
﻿Oh, that's because...

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.380
﻿Mr. Yasaka!?

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:10.580
﻿What...

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:15.280
﻿Sorry for not noticing.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.080
﻿That's alright.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:20.190
﻿Please leave it to me.

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.660
﻿You're our guest here, too.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.590
﻿Please relax in your room.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.990
﻿Don't say that.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.300
﻿I want to help you, Misaki!

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.200
﻿I appreciate the thought, but...

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.230
﻿Please let me!

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:38.740
﻿I... want to spend time with you.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:43.010
﻿He's as persistent as ever.

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:43.940
﻿So nice.

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:45.280
﻿Sei.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.520
﻿Is that guy really going
﻿to the World Tournament?

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:49.350
﻿You're kidding.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.690
﻿What did you just say?

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:53.750
﻿You're Mr. Reiji, right?

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:56.990
﻿Wanna see if I'm kidding?

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:59.930
﻿They have a battle system in this inn.

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:02.360
﻿Interesting.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.940
﻿Anyway, let's go see our room.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:09.740
﻿Please.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.570
﻿Y-Yes!

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.840
﻿This way, please.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.850
﻿Beautiful!

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.010
﻿Wow, great view!

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:22.780
﻿Oh?

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:27.590
﻿Ah, never mind, never mind.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:30.190
﻿By the way, China.

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.260
Yes?

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:33.590
﻿Why don't you go for a walk with Sei?

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:37.830
﻿I think you should learn from Mao!

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:40.400
﻿Um... I...

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.800
﻿Just go.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.110
﻿Right after checking in,
﻿this is what he does?

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:51.880
﻿Seeing Mao again must've
﻿rekindled his Gunpla spirit.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:55.320
﻿Well, it's better than him
﻿grinning all the time.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.550
﻿I agree.

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:59.550
You have only two months
﻿'til the World Tournament.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.960
﻿I'm going to have a bath.

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:05.190
﻿I'll go take a walk, too.

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:14.770
﻿Yes.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:21.710
﻿Oh, Kousaka.

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.280
﻿Sorry for disturbing you.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.680
﻿No! Come in.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:30.380
﻿What're you doing?

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.620
﻿I'm modifying the rifle a little.

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:35.390
﻿Wow, it looks cool.

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:38.290
﻿Um...

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:41.700
﻿I'm building a new Gunpla right now.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.530
﻿I'll have one of these!

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:50.500
﻿Oh

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:53.770
﻿Where did that Misaki go?

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:05.020
﻿Mr. Yasaka?

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:07.150
﻿Misaki!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.690
﻿Did you repair that?

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.260
﻿It's just a temporary fix.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.830
﻿That's my job.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.100
﻿No, please let me do it.

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:19.330
﻿But you're a guest...

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.540
﻿I'm very good at handicrafts.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:27.370
﻿I'm the guy who's gonna be
﻿the world's best Gunpla builder!

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:42.860
﻿Misaki!

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:47.760
﻿What's going on, mom?

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:50.230
﻿Take the guests
﻿and get away from here.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.830
﻿Are they here again?

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.470
﻿Just hurry!

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.570
﻿What's all this noise?

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.080
﻿Huh!?

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:03.240
﻿A crash!?

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:06.150
﻿What was that?

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.930
﻿What the heck is this!?

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:30.740
﻿Watch where you're going!

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:33.910
﻿Those guys...

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.010
﻿Say something!

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:37.880
﻿Shut up, kid.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.210
﻿So sorry, landlady.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:44.250
﻿It seems the brakes were faulty.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:48.960
﻿But you can't keep this inn
﻿open in this condition.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.590
﻿So now will you give us
﻿the rights to this dump?

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.800
﻿They want to buy the inn?

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.900
﻿They're typical land-sharks.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:05.710
﻿I don't think it's a bad deal.
﻿Sell us the rights.

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.440
﻿It doesn't matter
﻿how many times you come.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:10.110
﻿This inn has been handed down
﻿from generation to generation.

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.610
﻿I won't sell it to people like you!

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:13.780
﻿Yeah, go home!

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:15.980
﻿I see.

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:19.620
﻿So, you're the bad guys, right?

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:23.560
﻿Did you forget that
﻿I told you to shut up, kid?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.360
﻿Yeah, I did.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.960
﻿Who listens to bad guys?

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.660
﻿So you're looking for a beatdown.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:31.430
﻿Reiji!

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:33.530
﻿Stay back!

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:36.340
﻿Sei, this is my specialty.

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:38.070
﻿No, Reiji!

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:39.740
﻿She's right.

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:42.980
﻿Fighting is no good.

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.580
﻿Stay out of it, old man Ral!

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:47.080
﻿R-Ral!?

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.550
﻿L-Lieutenant.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:53.250
﻿Long time no see, Tatsuzo. No...

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:55.190
﻿Blazing Tatsu!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:57.390
﻿Do you know him?

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.790
﻿Yes. I certainly do.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:01.090
﻿Blazing Tatsu...

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:03.260
﻿Three years ago, I think,

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:08.000
﻿a Gunpla builder by that name
﻿fought in the World Tournament.

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:11.670
﻿He's a Gunpla builder?

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:14.340
﻿What happened, Tatsuzo?

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:19.810
﻿You drove people around the world
﻿into a frenzy with your Gunpla.

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.410
﻿So why...?

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:24.250
﻿Don't talk lightly about my past.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.650
﻿This is my job now!

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:28.160
﻿Keep your nose out of it!

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:31.590
﻿So, landlady,
﻿tell me what I want to hear.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:37.930
﻿If not, I'll keep coming back
﻿until this place is a vacant lot.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.130
﻿Wait!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:42.770
﻿Let's settle this with Gunpla!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.870
﻿Sei?

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:47.570
﻿You were a Gunpla builder, right?

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.880
﻿Then let's settle this in Gunpla Battle!

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:53.710
﻿Yeah!

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:56.880
﻿If we win, don't ever
﻿bother Misaki's family again!

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:59.390
﻿Shut up, kid!

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:00.620
﻿Okay then.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.930
﻿But if I win,
﻿I'll take the rights for free.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.930
﻿Oh no...

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.670
﻿Mr. Yasaka...

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.370
﻿We accept your conditions!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.810
﻿Misaki!?

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.540
﻿Trust me, mom.

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:23.580
﻿I don't want to lose this place
﻿without doing anything!

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:27.880
﻿Okay, it's a deal.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:31.520
﻿I can take you on all at once, kids.

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:33.450
﻿You think it's that easy?

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.920
﻿I'm returning a favor.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.460
﻿You made my job easier.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.470
<i>﻿Field 5, City.</i>

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.440
<i>﻿Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.670
﻿Let's go, Sei and Mao!

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:53.370
﻿- Yeah!
- ﻿I'm ready!

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:04.720
<i>﻿Battle start.</i>

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.390
﻿- Gundam X Maoh!
﻿- Build Gundam Mk-II!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:11.420
﻿Let's go!

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.540
﻿What firepower.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:33.380
﻿That's...

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:39.850
﻿Heavy assault mobile armor,
﻿Apsalus III!

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:41.990
﻿That's right.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:48.160
﻿This is the ultimate Gunpla
﻿that swept the world!

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.670
﻿Just because your Gunpla's big—!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:55.570
﻿It bounced off!?

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.570
﻿Is that an I-field!?

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.870
﻿It didn't have one
﻿in the official setting!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.410
﻿There's no doubt.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:10.250
﻿It deflects the Plavsky particles,
﻿and repels the particle beams!

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:16.460
﻿That's the Gunpla that fought through
﻿the World Tournament for sure!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:28.700
﻿Why did the beam bounce off?

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.670
﻿The surface of the Gunpla
﻿is specially treated...

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:34.140
﻿to alter the Plavsky particles.

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:37.040
﻿That's just like Tatsuzo. He's tough.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:39.710
﻿Should you be so relaxed!?

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:48.920
﻿You restless kid!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:56.400
﻿Wh-What!?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.330
﻿What's this gas?

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.610
﻿An Adzam Leader!?

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.510
﻿Dam. It won't move!

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.720
﻿Isn't there anything we can do, Sei!?

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:24.420
﻿Iori!

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:26.490
﻿Can't they do something?

00:18:26.490 --> 00:18:27.890
﻿No, they can't.

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:32.530
﻿Nobody has ever escaped
﻿from this blazing inferno.

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:36.000
﻿Landlady, keep your promise!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:50.250
﻿How did they...?

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:53.720
﻿Bouncing beams by
﻿altering the particles...

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:56.190
﻿You aren't the only one
﻿who knows that technique!

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:00.560
﻿Old guy!

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:04.330
﻿How could you do this to Misaki?

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.530
﻿Fool!

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:08.940
﻿The Satellite System won't work
﻿if the moon hasn't come out.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:11.100
﻿Who do you think I am!?

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:18.280
﻿I'm the guy who's gonna be
﻿the world's best Gunpla builder.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.710
﻿Mao Yasaka.

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:23.380
﻿The heir apparent to the
﻿Gunpla Shingyo school!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:24.980
﻿You...

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.290
﻿Are you Chinan's pupil!?

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:33.890
﻿Remember it!

00:19:58.390 --> 00:19:59.620
﻿Sei and Reiji!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:01.720
﻿Okay!

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.630
﻿Take this!

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:24.180
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.480
﻿Yes, they did it!

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:35.320
﻿Mr. Yasaka.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.220
﻿Thank you, everyone.

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:45.470
﻿How... How come my blaze didn't...

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:47.900
﻿Tatsuzo.

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:51.000
﻿Gunpla is constantly evolving.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:55.910
﻿The goddess of victory won't smile on
﻿those who neglect their daily efforts.

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:58.480
﻿One more thing.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:01.580
﻿Keep your promise to the landlady.

00:21:02.020 --> 00:21:03.920
﻿L-Lieutenant...

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:11.020
﻿Well, I'll be leaving now.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:12.130
﻿Mao.

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:15.230
﻿Seriously, thank you for yesterday.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:17.030
﻿Please be sure to come again.

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:20.270
﻿Of course I will!

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:23.700
﻿I'll win the qualifying tournament
﻿every year and come back.

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:25.940
﻿I'll be waiting.

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:30.910
﻿Oh, look at him.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:36.350
﻿By the way, Mr. Reiji,
﻿we still have to fight it out.

00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:38.890
﻿Bring it on.

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:41.250
﻿More importantly...

00:21:42.020 --> 00:21:44.390
﻿How did you fire the
﻿hyper satellite cannon,

00:21:44.390 --> 00:21:46.560
﻿without the super microwave system?

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:51.560
﻿I can't tell you that.

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:52.900
﻿It's top secret.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:55.500
﻿Okay.

00:21:58.010 --> 00:22:02.340
﻿We'll definitely win
﻿in the World Tournament.

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.980
﻿I'll start building a new Gunpla
﻿as soon as we get home.

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:06.410
﻿I'm counting on you.

00:22:07.210 --> 00:22:08.280
﻿You got it!

00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:41.040
﻿It's finally complete.

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:47.980
﻿The works model our PPSE research
﻿team used all its resources to build.

00:23:48.750 --> 00:23:50.920
﻿Of course, its fighter is you.

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:54.090
﻿Kawaguchi.

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:58.280
﻿You'll be meeting more
﻿World Tournament contestants.

00:23:58.280 --> 00:24:00.510
﻿It's getting exciting!

00:24:00.510 --> 00:24:02.280
Next episode, "Encounter of Fighters".

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:04.980
What will you bet and what will be left behind?
